OL,3,GNEWSAParking fines sent to intensive
OL,4,Acare patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been issued four parking
OL,7,Ffines and sent a letter from a debt
OL,8,Fcollection company while she was
OL,9,F"fighting for her life" in hospital.
OL,11,FDavid Matthews, from Elloughton, said
OL,12,Fhis daughter, Kate, 36, has been
OL,13,Freceiving treatment at Hull Royal
OL,14,FInfirmary since March and had spent
OL,15,Ftime in intensive care.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
