OL,3,GNEWSAParking fines sent to intensive
OL,4,Acare patient
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid said he had been paying for
OL,7,Fweekly parking permits for his
OL,8,Fdaughter's car but had still received
OL,9,Fthe penalty notices. He added he had
OL,10,Ftried to contact parking company APCOA
OL,11,Fbut was told they would only speak to
OL,12,Fthe registered owner of the vehicle.
OL,14,FThe NHS Humber Health Partnership and
OL,15,FAPCOA have apologised and have
OL,16,Fcancelled the charges.
